Subject: [PATCH 2160/2160] drm/panel-edp: Add LG LP129WT342166 (Surface Pro 11
 LCD)

The internal eDP panel of the LCD Microsoft Surface Pro 11th Edition is
not in edp_panels[], so panel-edp falls back to conservative timings and
warns at every boot:

  panel-simple-dp-aux aux-aea0000.displayport-controller: Unknown panel LGD 0x077b, using conservative timings

EDID, read from /sys/class/drm/card1-eDP-1/edid:

  00 ff ff ff ff ff ff 00 30 e4 7b 07 a1 21 00 13
  00 21 01 04 b5 1b 12 78 03 f0 70 aa 50 4e a8 26
  0e 4f 53 00 00 00 01 01 01 01 01 01 01 01 01 01
  01 01 01 01 01 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 fd 00 18 78 f0
  f0 48 01 0a 20 20 20 20 20 20 00 00 00 fe 00 4c
  47 44 5f 44 56 31 2e 30 5f 0a 20 20 00 00 00 fe
  00 4c 50 31 32 39 57 54 33 34 32 31 36 36 01 44
  70 20 79 02 00 20 00 19 3c e6 24 7b 07 a1 21 00
  13 00 17 0d 4c 50 31 32 39 57 54 33 34 32 31 36
  36 21 00 1d b4 0a 26 07 40 0b 80 07 00 ac aa 50
  e1 f4 a7 62 e2 0e f2 f4 52 b0 60 b0 60 99 35 13
  78 26 00 09 06 00 00 00 00 00 40 00 00 22 00 28
  c0 e9 0a 84 3f 0b 63 00 07 80 1f 00 7f 07 4f 00
  41 00 07 00 c0 e9 0a 04 3f 0b 63 00 07 80 1f 00
  7f 07 1f 08 41 00 07 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 cd 90

No datasheet is available, so use delay_200_500_e200_d200, as for the
previous generation of this 12.9" panel, the LP129WT232166 (LGD 0x06b2).

Assisted-by: LLM

---
 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-edp.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-edp.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-edp.c
index 9a5971afa..ce70e9758 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-edp.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-edp.c
@@ -2188,6 +2188,7 @@ static const struct edp_panel_entry edp_panels[] = {
 	EDP_PANEL_ENTRY('L', 'G', 'D', 0x05f1, &delay_200_500_e200_d200, "Unknown"),
 	EDP_PANEL_ENTRY('L', 'G', 'D', 0x06b2, &delay_200_500_e200_d200, "LP129WT232166"),
 	EDP_PANEL_ENTRY('L', 'G', 'D', 0x0778, &delay_200_500_e200_d200, "134WT1"),
+	EDP_PANEL_ENTRY('L', 'G', 'D', 0x077b, &delay_200_500_e200_d200, "LP129WT342166"),
 	EDP_PANEL_ENTRY('L', 'G', 'D', 0x07fe, &delay_200_500_e200_d200, "LP116WHA-SPB1"),
 
 	EDP_PANEL_ENTRY('S', 'H', 'P', 0x1511, &delay_200_500_e50, "LQ140M1JW48"),
-- 
